# The image build copies only what the Dockerfile names; this keeps the build
# CONTEXT small and keeps unneeded local state out of it. third_party/ is the
# big one: the build stage fetches fteqw itself (fetch_third_party.sh), so the
# vendored sources never have to cross the context.
.git
.gitignore
.team
AGENT.md
AGENTS.md
ASSETS-CREDITS.md
PROJECT.md
README.md
build
crash.log
client
node_modules
package.json
package-lock.json
screens
static
tests
third_party
tools
web/fte
